### Get a token (current route)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@scheldt.example",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Old login route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Customers (old name for policyholders)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Policy holders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/PolicyHolders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Policy holder by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/PolicyHolders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Contracts (old name for policies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Policies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Policies?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Policies/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyHolderId": 1,
  "productType": "Travel",
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "paymentFrequency": "Annual",
  "coverages": [ "Travel" ],
  "travel": { "scope": "Europe", "partyType": "Single" }
}

### Old claims route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Claims
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Claim search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/search?q=storm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoices (old billing route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/billing/invoices?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/export?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
